摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Claude Pro/Max OAuth model provider for DeepSeek Harness with Google/Gmail login in Settings, auto-token refresh, live model discovery, and real-time quota tracking","id":"gh:1359041061","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-claude-oauth","slug":"grloper/dsh-claude-oauth","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","oauth"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Claude Pro/Max OAuth model provider for DeepSeek Harness with Google/Gmail login in Settings, auto-t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oken refresh, live model discovery, and real-time quota tracking"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-claude-oauth"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Claude Pro / Max OAuth integration for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** — sign in directly with your Googl"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e / Gmail account from the DSH Web Settings page, with automatic token rotation, live model discover"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"y, and real-time 5-hour / 7-day subscription quota tracking."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · Technical Article"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Verification boundary"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The source contains an OAuth PKCE callback flow, credential synchronization, model discovery, and qu"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ota probing. These are implementation claims, not evidence of current upstream authorization or DSH "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"compatibility. No live login, token refresh, credential file access, model request, or quota probe w"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"as performed in this review. The quota implementation calls `/v1/messages` with `max_tokens: 1`; it "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"is an inference request and should not be described as a free read-only probe."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"`npm run check` checks syntax; `npm test` verifies six metadata/header/PKCE/HTML-escaping cases. Tho"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"se tests do not exercise the host plugin lifecycle, callback validation, token storage, refresh, or "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"UI. The SVG below is a design asset, not a captured authenticated runtime demo. Existing compatibili"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ty badges are unverified. Callback error and profile text now escapes HTML markup before rendering; "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"authentication scopes, token exchange and credential behavior are unchanged."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Key Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"* 🚀 **One-Click Google / Gmail Sign-In in Settings**: Dedicated **Claude** section in DSH Settings ("},{"id":"p10s2","text":"`order: 13`, beside Antigravity and Codex). Click **\"Sign in with Google / Gmail\"** to authenticate "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"directly in your browser.\n* ⚡ **Zero Terminal Hassle**: No manual CLI token dumping, copying strings"},{"id":"p10s4","text":", or editing YAML config files.\n* 🔄 **Dual-Stack PKCE OAuth Engine**: Ephemeral loopback callback se"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"rver listening on dual-stack IPv4 (`127.0.0.1`) and IPv6 (`::1`), avoiding Windows localhost resolut"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ion traps.\n* 🛡️ **Multi-Store Credential Sync**: Exchanged tokens automatically sync to:\n* `~/.claud"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"e/.credentials.json` (shares authorization with the official Claude Code CLI)\n* `~/.dsh/.credentials"},{"id":"p10s8","text":".yaml` (`ANTHROPIC_OAUTH_TOKEN` and `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`)\n* `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` (configures "},{"id":"p10s9","text":"`llm-pi-ai.providers.anthropic` with active models)\n* 📊 **Live Subscription Quota Meters**: Displays"},{"id":"p10s10","text":" real-time **5-hour** and **7-day** quota utilization bars with reset countdowns in both Settings an"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"d the ambient chat composer dock.\n* 🤖 **Live Model Catalog**: Queries `GET /v1/models` dynamically. "},{"id":"p10s12","text":"All latest Claude releases (Claude 3.7 Sonnet, Claude Sonnet 4.5, Claude Opus 4.5, Claude Haiku 4.5)"},{"id":"p10s13","text":" mount automatically."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Architecture Flow"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Installation"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install `dsh-claude-oauth` into your active DSH Web profile:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Sign In via Web Settings"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Start or open DeepSeek Harness Web GUI:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"2. Open **Settings** (gear icon on the sidebar).\n3. Select the **Claude** section from the navigatio"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"n list.\n4. Click **\"Sign in with Google / Gmail\"**.\n5. In the opened browser window, choose **\"Conti"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"nue with Google\"**, pick your Gmail account, and click **Authorize**.\n6. The tab will display **\"Cla"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ude Connected\"**. Return to DSH — your account email, tier (`CLAUDE PRO` or `CLAUDE MAX`), live quot"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"a bars, and models are now active!"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Optional: Sign In via CLI"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"You can also authenticate directly from the command line using the bundled bin script:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Setting Claude as Default Agent Model"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"To make Claude Sonnet 4.5 your default model for all sessions:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"In `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Or pick Claude per-session from the composer model selector."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Verification & Testing"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Run the included test suite:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"MIT © 2026 grloper"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
